        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Shooter Where Your Bullets Hurt You!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge your own challenges, and be wise about when to shoot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is separate from the last, with different upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move slower for more accuracy, or quickly turn around to run away</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915550/extras/a0fa6730df4985b18da927976aa15c88.poster.avif?t=1762759387\" aria-label=\"Shooting Enemys\" width=342 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915550/extras/a0fa6730df4985b18da927976aa15c88.webm?t=1762759387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915550/extras/a0fa6730df4985b18da927976aa15c88.mp4?t=1762759387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Types:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915550/extras/a83a0c271eaf951517c3be3a9ce9dbb7.webp?t=1762759387\" width=25 height=25 /></span>  | Unique Bullets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915550/extras/0b7795aa0880d20cc3e774cbafe54de7.webp?t=1762759387\" width=25 height=25 /></span>  | Auto-Shooter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915550/extras/d01770af85f95c4b65dd4ff9b5f34452.webp?t=1762759387\" width=25 height=25 /></span>  | Bullet Power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915550/extras/29556f3e93fca269f48aa6d43c3dbab0.webp?t=1762759387\" width=25 height=25 /></span>  | Time Manipulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915550/extras/a38add311e3a1e5f423482c1a9bb546f.webp?t=1762759387\" width=25 height=25 /></span>  | Life Grace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915550/extras/5fb9c1e084f9284a9c225adea5d01751.webp?t=1762759387\" width=25 height=25 /></span>  | Defence</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Not all upgrades are designed to help you.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915550/extras/21bf18a6ba82840f58b5e011d1d13168.poster.avif?t=1762759387\" aria-label=\"Dodging Bullets\" width=432 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915550/extras/21bf18a6ba82840f58b5e011d1d13168.webm?t=1762759387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915550/extras/21bf18a6ba82840f58b5e011d1d13168.mp4?t=1762759387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD to move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Click / Space to shoot</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>\\\\\\\\\\ Other Controls \\\\\\\\\\</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Q for Ability 1</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>E for Ability 2</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Right Click for dashing</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Aim dash with mouse</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>R to 'reset'</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upcoming</strong> <i>(before release)</i><strong>:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>More biomes</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fun Movement Stuff</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bug Fixes and QoL!</i></p></li></ul>",
